Cellos adaptations after S7-1 (S7-3, D76-2)
-------------------------------------------
src/regex/config.rs: the one-pass DFA size limit follows the configured
size_limit (upstream: fixed 10 MiB), so a small size_limit bounds every
compiled engine.
src/walk.rs (vigrep-authored): resumable segmented search (Step, Begun,
Walker::begin_file, FileSearch, ResumeInput, ResumableSearch, ResumeError;
Walker::search_file is begin_file + step), line_submatches (rg printer
submatch rule moved from tests/differential/main.rs, capped, and measured
from the start of the input instead of the searcher buffer), packed pending
children with max_pending_bytes / max_pending_entries.
tests/differential/main.rs: uses line_submatches; adds a forced-pause run
(pause after every row and every third row) against expected.txt
(unchanged). Upstream-derived searcher files are untouched.

